<title>GEORGIA: Georgia inflation quickens to 3.1 pct in February.</title>
<headline>Georgia inflation quickens to 3.1 pct in February.</headline>
<dateline>TBILISI 1997-03-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Georgian consumer prices rose 3.1 percent in February after a 0.8 percent rise in January, the State Socio-economic Information Committee said on Thursday.</p>
<p>    GEORGIAN CONSUMER PRICES	Feb'97    Jan'97   Feb'96</p>
<p>    Monthly pct change		 +3.1	+0.8     +3.6</p>
<p>    Year-on-year pct change	 +10.8     +11.5    +45.9</p>
<p>--Tbilisi Newsroom (+995 32) 983 961</p>
</text>
